      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Made an account to agree with this. So far, what have ranks done for the community?\n\n-Introduced cliques, hierarchy, and segregation to a formerly welcoming atmosphere\n-Created frustration and confusion for new players who are continually gated out of content privileges\n-Created frustration and confusion for OLD players as well, who may not necessarily want to make/upload content in order to be able to enjoy the full experience, hint hint\n-Failed its original goal to prevent obnoxious avatars where blanket safety settings/per-user settings serve the purpose far better\n\nGating newer users is acceptable to prevent abuse of alts, but the higher ranks have accomplished nothing good.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
